    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "**Cash buyers only** McCormack Estates are delighted to present 37 Holywell Avenue to the market For Sale.\r\n\r\nThis spacious two bedroom top floor apartment comes to market in excellent condition throughout and will appeal to investors given it's strong rental potential. Accommodation comprises of an entrance hallway leading upstairs, spacious living area with private balcony access, fully fitted kitchen, utility room, two double bedrooms and a family bathroom.\r\n\r\nThe M1 motorway is nearby offering easy access throughout the City. The area is also very well served with bus routes. The area benefits from primary and secondary schools and crèches and there are numerous sporting facilities and recreational activities in the area. There are ample communal parking spaces to the front of the property.\r\n\r\n*The property is available to cash buyers only, further details are available upon request.*\r\n\r\n*Please note we have not tested any apparatus, fixtures, fittings, or services. Interested parties must undertake their own investigation into the working order of these items. All measurements are approximate and photographs provided for guidance only."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
