        "Content": "Entrance Hallway 4.90m x 1.0m\r\n\r\nUtility Room 1.90m x 3.0m\r\n\r\nKitchen 2.60m x 3.60m\r\n\r\nLounge/Dining Room 3.10m x 5.50m\r\n\r\nBedroom 1 3.0m x 2.40m\r\n\r\nBedroom 2 2.80m x 2.60m\r\n\r\nBathroom 2.20m x 1.70m\r\n\r\nTotal floor area c. 60 Sq.m / 645 Sq.ft"
